GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "A5E83C28D3351F19"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{404FD76F66D01EB9}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "Special forces from the Chernarus Defence Force conduct a deliberate assault to secure a Russian headquarters operating along the Zherebets river. "\
     ""
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{920ECD24608701B7}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "<b>DTL:</b> 01/08/2024, 0600hrs, Zarichne, Chernarus."\
     "<b>Weather:</b> Overcast, visibility 1km+, with a forecast of changing conditions."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "Russia and Chernarus have been engaged in a large-scale conflict for the past two years, with fighting continuing across the country and along the front lines."\
     ""\
     "Throughout July, Chernarus Defence Forces have conducted a series of offensive operations against Russian positions in an effort to disrupt their presence and weaken their ability to operate throughout the region."\
     ""\
     "Zarichne has now become the focus of another operation. A Russian trench system on the outskirts of the a town, running along the Zherebets River, has been identified as a key defensive position supporting Russian operations in the area."\
     ""\
     "With both sides now committed to the area, fighting is expected to develop around the trench system and the nearby Russian headquarters. The outcome of the engagement could determine who maintains control of this section of Zarichne and the surrounding river line."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CDF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B0E3B9B1525036CA}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "<b>DTL:</b> 01/08/2024, 0600hrs, Zarichne, Chernarus."\
     "<b>Weather:</b> Overcast, visibility 1km+, with a forecast of changing conditions."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "Russia and Chernarus have been engaged in a large-scale conflict for the past two years, with fighting continuing across the country and along the front lines."\
     ""\
     "Throughout July, Chernarus Defence Forces have conducted a series of offensive operations against Russian positions in an effort to disrupt their presence and weaken their ability to operate throughout the region."\
     ""\
     "Zarichne has now become the focus of another operation. A Russian trench system on the outskirts of the a town, running along the Zherebets River, has been identified as a key defensive position supporting Russian operations in the area."\
     ""\
     "With both sides now committed to the area, fighting is expected to develop around the trench system and the nearby Russian headquarters. The outcome of the engagement could determine who maintains control of this section of Zarichne and the surrounding river line."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5513307B581E5D05}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "This area contains approximately a platoon+ Russian infantry from the <b>2nd Motor Rifle Platoon, 1st Motor Rifle Company</b>. Russian forces are dug into a network of trenches containing several fighting positions and bunkers."\
     "The main enemy position is centred around a subterranean concrete bunker, which serves as the Russian HQ for the area."\
     ""\
     "The initial trench position near our dismount point has been abandoned following preparatory artillery strikes and after seeing us make landfall close by."\
     ""\
     "We should expect an armoured QRF to eventually arrive if we take to long. Overhead observation is monitoring the surrounding approach routes and will warn us if a QRF is spotted."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Well-established defensive positions consisting of trenches, bunkers, and fortified fighting positions."\
     "• An NSV heavy machine gun provides significant firepower and coverage over the surrounding area. Reference the marker for its location."\
     "• The subterranean HQ provides a hardened position and is expected to be the centre of enemy operations."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CDF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0ABAC1C9CCDFBE19}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces appear to be special forces from the Chernarus Defence Force. They've dismounted from their boats along the Zherebets river directly next to our foward river postion. "\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Exepct drone support. It could be one, it could be two, droppers or FPV, just expect drones at all times."\
     "• Modern weaponry with all the gizmos and gadgets."\
     "• Night IR and low light capabilites."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• Enemy support capabilities are unknown."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{485D9B17C362955D}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Our unit is a strike team from the Chernarus Defence Force (CDF), Raven SOF Company, consisting of 23 personnel. We are currently located at our boat dismount point along the Zherebets River."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• We have two Mavic drone with17x VOG-25 impact grenades, with 3 spare batteries stored in the equipment box beside HQ's boat."\
     "• All personnel are equipped with long-range optics."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• None."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CDF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DA8EF7C16067A1A5}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are the <b>2nd Motor Rifle Platoon, 1st Motor Rifle Company</b>, consisting of a platoon-plus strength. Our forces are dug into a defensive position along the Zherebets River, centred around the subterranean concrete bunker serving as our local HQ."\
     "Our squad starts at HQ."\
     ""\
     "Our foward unit in the riverside trench has withdrawn after coming under artillery bombardment and observing CDF forces making landfall along the river."\
     ""\
     "A QRF is forming up approximately 6km west of our position. They will begin moving towards us as soon as possible."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• We have a network of trenches containing several fighting positions and bunkers."\
     "• An NSV heavy machine gun is positioned at the marked location, providing significant firepower and coverage over the surrounding area."\
     "• Our subterranean concrete HQ provides a hardened defensive position and serves as the centre of our operations."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• None."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DDD43DFEEE23A7EC}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>  "\
     "Conduct a <b>DELIBERATE ASSAULT</b> to <b>OCCUPY & SECURE</b> the Russian HQ bunker."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "Russian forces have established a fortified defensive position along the Zherebets River to control the flow of water movements and crossings, centred around a subterranean concrete bunker serving as their local HQ. Following artillery strikes against the outer trench positions, the initial guard presence near our dismount point has withdrawn back to the main trench once they saw us coming."\
     ""\
     "We are to assault through the remaining Russian defences, clear the surrounding trench network, and <b>OCCUPY & SECURE</b> the HQ bunker. Expect determined resistance from the remaining Russian forces defending the position."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CDF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{80A01E37F25F49D0}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Conduct a <b>DELIBERATE DEFENCE</b> to <b>HOLD</b> our HQ and defensive positions against the assault."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "CDF special forces have established a position along the Zherebets River and are preparing to assault our defensive line. Their objective is to overrun our trench system and seize our subterranean HQ, which serves as the centre of our operations in the area."\
     ""\
     "The outer trench position near the river has already been abandoned following artillery strikes, leaving the remaining defensive positions exposed. We must use our prepared trenches, bunkers, and fighting positions to delay and repel the CDF assault."\
     ""\
     "<b>HOLD THE HQ.</b> Do not allow the CDF to occupy the bunker and take control of our position."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E6FD936C0693BB44}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "<h2>CALLSIGNS</h2>"\
     "• HQ - 430"\
